OL,3,GNEWSACommunity pool saved after
OL,4,A#178,000 council boost
OL,5,
OL,6,FA community-run swimming pool in
OL,7,FLincolnshire has been given a lifeline
OL,8,Fthanks to a council donation of almost
OL,9,F#178,000.
OL,11,FNorth Lincolnshire Council invested in
OL,12,FEpworth Swimming Pool so its changing
OL,13,Froom, entrance and viewing areas could
OL,14,Fbe refurbished. Work was expected to
OL,15,Fstart in November, the council said.
OL,17,FThe funding comes after South Axholme
OL,18,FCommunity Swimming Pool Association,
OL,19,Fwhich operates the pool, appealed for
OL,20,Fhelp last year amid rising costs.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
