OL,3,GNEWSACommunity pool saved after
OL,4,A#178,000 council boost
OL,5,
OL,6,FManager and trustee Rob Jenkins said:
OL,7,F"We're confident this major
OL,8,Frefurbishment will give residents many
OL,9,Fmore years of swimming here locally."
